§ `Part II — Articles 7 to 9`

§§ `Article 7 — The claim file`

-- src:331 | Điều 7. Hồ sơ bồi thường
-- src:332 | Đối với từng vụ việc cụ thể thì Hồ sơ bồi thường bao gồm một hoặc nhiều loại tài liệu
-- src:333 | sau:
-- "One or more of the following": the Article lists what a file MAY contain for a given
-- case, and leaves the choice to the case. So the rule below lists what the Article can
-- ask for on the facts; it does not say what makes a file "complete and valid", which is
-- what starts the clocks of 4.2.3 and 4.2.4. The Rules never say (finding X6).
DECLARE `A claim document` IS ONE OF
    `7.1.1 notice of the accident and claim, on the insurer's form`
    `7.1.2(a) the certificate and other written agreements`
    `7.1.2(b) the vehicle registration and the driver's valid licence`
    `7.1.2(c) papers on a sale, transfer, gift or authorised use of the vehicle`
    `7.1.2(d) a valid inspection certificate`
    `7.1.3(a) valid vouchers for the repair or replacement`
    `7.1.3(b) papers proving costs spent to limit the damage or on the insurer's instructions`
    `7.1.4 the record of agreement or mediation`
    `7.1.5 the court's judgment or decision`
    `7.1.6 papers transferring to the insurer the right to recover from the third party`
    `7.2.1(a) the police record of examination of the scene`
    `7.2.1(b) the police sketch of the scene, and photographs`
    `7.2.1(c) the police record of examination of the vehicles`
    `7.2.1(d) the police preliminary notice of the first investigation`
    `7.2.1(e) the police record of settlement, and the conclusion of the investigation`
    `7.2.2(a) papers on the third party's fault and liability`
    `7.2.2(b) papers on the insured's subrogation`
    `7.2.3 the assessment record of cause and extent agreed by the parties`
    `7.3 other relevant documents`
    `7.4.1 the theft report, certified by the police`
    `7.4.2 the decision to prosecute and investigate`
    `7.4.3 the decision suspending the investigation or the prosecution`
    `7.4.4 the police-certified declaration of papers lost with the vehicle`

